    "DialogText": "Ah, @p. The journey ahead will be perilous, but together we can succeed. You carry a heavy burden, and I know the weight of duty all too well. Gondor has stood against the enemy for generations... alone, holding back the tide of darkness.

I will stand with you, for the fate of Middle-earth rests on this mission. But remember, we must be strong, for the Ring is a dangerous weapon. We cannot allow it to fall into the hands of the Enemy.

I’ll protect you, and together we shall face whatever dangers await. You have my sword, and the strength of Gondor.

